      "default": "Dogs don't tell you the bed has stopped working.\nThey show you."
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "note",
      "label": "Closing line",
      "default": "Ageing isn't something a bed can undo. What a bed can change is how much work it takes to lie down – and to get back up again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "cta_text",
      "label": "Button",
      "default": "Find the right bed"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "cta_link",
      "label": "Button link"
    },
    {
